{
  "epId": 7431,
  "name": "西风骑士团",
  "desc": "<p>负责维护蒙德城秩序，同时也守护蒙德城「自由」这一信条的组织。虽然被称之为骑士，但并非是由谁所封 — 西风骑士是背负了高贵之责任，因此能以此自豪的头衔。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/10/326985891/9bd657b2f14508ea8c0f5e28d6c81c07_3781092691165143655.png",
  "menuId": 23,
  "menuName": "组织",
  "version": 1763185734,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名大团长"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4901,
        "name": "温妮莎",
        "desc": "<p>曾沦为奴隶，西风骑士团的创建者兼初代团长，有蒲公英骑士的称号。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/04/13/157749474/843dd2247159897d9be7c5a528e90a43_6160478244892773079.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "西风骑士团的创立者，也是初代大团长。\n艾伦德林\n生活于500年前的「光之狮」、大团长。\n法尔伽\n将组织交给",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 27,
        "name": "琴",
        "desc": "正直严谨的蒲公英骑士，蒙德西风骑士团的代理团长。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/dc4d21c71b5edcb3e41d225b315c26a5_5050188703815898410.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "代理，并踏上远征之路的现任大团长。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "小队"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "第二小队\n该小队的队长是诺特。\n第三小队\n该小队的队长是斯凯戎。\n第四小队\n游击小队负责维护城市周边的安全并对抗魔物。浪花骑士，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6,
        "name": "优菈",
        "desc": "古老家族出身的「浪花骑士」，西风骑士团游击小队队长。身为旧贵族后裔却加入了堪称死对头的西风骑士团，该事件至今仍是蒙德一大谜团。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/d2201d00f4b88d1701d3e70701e73bc4_97528772977352915.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "担任西风骑士团游击小队队长。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3462,
        "name": "米卡",
        "desc": "<p>平凡家庭出身的年轻骑士，在小队中担任「前进测绘员」一职。为人低调，谨小慎微。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/20/47826599/da13e3b1a2c6c0e5892b201cec735f9b_1268190137665516330.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "是该小队的前进测绘员。\n第六小队\n该小队是负责后勤工作。协调员",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2549,
        "name": "赫塔",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/06/26/47826599/1a62007a81d906ac3575f1526e74a363_5194594823850749492.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "是担任第六小队队长。\n第七小队\n第七小队暂被编为「联兵小队」，该小队整合了具备各类能力的骑士组成一个作战单位，兼顾远程与近战火力。该小队对游击支援的依赖性极强。资深指挥官芙蕾德莉卡·古恩希尔德或将担任队长。小队成员包括方妮雅与艾玛托。\n第八小队\n大团长曾有意任命",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2,
        "name": "丽莎",
        "desc": "慵懒而博学的图书管理员，须弥教令院「两百年一见」的天才毕业生。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/736998dd647ad5eb9aa6b8f9a831950d_7134371114525998574.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "为第八小队队长，但遭到了她的拒绝。目前该小队的队长是外勤官，尼姆芙。\n第九小队\n目前，骑兵小队的大部分成员都随法尔伽一同远征在外。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9,
        "name": "凯亚",
        "desc": "异国面容的剑斗士，西风骑士团的头脑派人物。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/a59b105ea80a314fc010e1886667facb_5543474485028551497.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "是担任西风骑士团的骑兵小队队长。\n调查小队",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 47,
        "name": "阿贝多",
        "desc": "西风骑士团首席炼金术士兼调查小队队长，被称做「白垩之子」的天才。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/b71663c01dc525a09e5591522d2d7943_625618156455509442.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "是西风骑士团的首席炼金术士，同时也是担任调查小队队长。该小队成员还包括",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 30,
        "name": "砂糖",
        "desc": "对万物充满好奇的炼金术士，「生物炼金」学派的研究者。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/c89e6cb0c50857edfd5ff438db3879de_3523850344623399779.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "与",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2547,
        "name": "蒂玛乌斯",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/06/26/47826599/7b348be20f8d73d0846912a09793a868_3411380680846731180.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。\n侦察小队",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 14,
        "name": "安柏",
        "desc": "永远充满活力的女孩，骑士团最优秀，同时也是最后的侦察骑士。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/5e5c09879e341005a84671eb0032f826_5260597144803269830.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "是西风骑士团唯一的侦察骑士。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名成员"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 27,
        "name": "琴",
        "desc": "正直严谨的蒲公英骑士，蒙德西风骑士团的代理团长。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/dc4d21c71b5edcb3e41d225b315c26a5_5050188703815898410.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "蒲公英骑士、狮牙骑士、蒙德西风骑士团的代理团长。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 43,
        "name": "迪卢克",
        "desc": "坐拥蒙德大半酒业的贵公子，财力、人望、能力都令人无法小觑。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/c284c60a2d3817334cc8b89e7f90a0be_2406604934521867494.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "曾任骑兵队长，在父亲离世后便退出了该组织。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2,
        "name": "丽莎",
        "desc": "慵懒而博学的图书管理员，须弥教令院「两百年一见」的天才毕业生。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/736998dd647ad5eb9aa6b8f9a831950d_7134371114525998574.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "西风骑士团的图书管理员。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 12,
        "name": "可莉",
        "desc": "西风骑士团禁闭室的常客，蒙德的爆破大师。人称「逃跑的太阳」。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/ca5fba7e25bd27e309de326cfaf925bd_1110028334539129241.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "火花骑士。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 20,
        "name": "旅行者",
        "desc": "从世界之外漂流而来的旅行者，被神带走血亲，自此踏上寻找七神之路。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/04f769b0b1671b5ffbbafefd7286b4b2_8705621070531496665.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "荣誉骑士。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 40,
        "name": "诺艾尔",
        "desc": "「西风骑士团」的可靠女仆，梦想有一天能成为正式的骑士。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/c6170d2c621267f83532970e6f3f0599_4882371738469746329.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "一位女仆。\n鲁斯坦\n大团长艾伦德林的得力副手，并获得「幼狼」称号。他于",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7089,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期间逝世。\n纯白骑士\n一位在灾变期间对抗不公的骑士，最终沦为了染血骑士。\n伊洛克\n下令掩盖迪卢克的父亲死因、最终导致这位骑兵队长退出组织的督察长。\n安柏的爷爷\n侦察小队的创立者。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3598,
        "name": "霍夫曼",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/11/88072335/50f27d737c49542212aec45ce68b97e6_4034506461717993703.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "米卡·施密特的哥哥。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2560,
        "name": "阿拉米",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/06/27/47826599/db4597b2c136d158c4d4412e7af8ec95_8771741719653161196.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3395,
        "name": "斯万",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/09/47826599/3b53ff1630e2ceaa6b91aa5d91945c49_6813943494838970499.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "西风骑士。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "西风教会"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "西蒙·佩奇\n「拂晓的枢机卿」、西风教会的大主教，同时也是琴与芭芭拉的父亲。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 35,
        "name": "芭芭拉",
        "desc": "蒙德城的大家都喜欢芭芭拉。「偶像」这个词是她从一本杂志里看到的。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/bb74efb2a06b3bc511e6919cefcf4af6_6798297105610301514.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "西风教会的祈礼牧师。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7707,
        "name": "塔利雅",
        "desc": "西风教会的助祭，风神在教会的代行人。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/06/16/255dedc5048565aec2c5af510c6f74a5_7726536808309970424.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "西风教会的助祭。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 33,
        "name": "罗莎莉亚",
        "desc": "除了打扮哪里都不像神职人员的修女。冷淡的言行中透着锐利。总是单独行动。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/d6738afede9d238e1035a5b70d5f7332_3447459868788459339.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "被法尔伽大团长送往西风教会的修女。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "相关书籍与物品"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2353,
        "name": "骑士团指导手册·第五版",
        "desc": "<p>蒙德西风骑士团的日常言行守则，经过了本届代理团长琴的亲自修订。合格的骑士应当严格依照其规定规范自己的言行。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/03/17/157749474/620d13357a26632a41ecfbf1cd648153_8754587848422847090.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2017,
        "name": "西风剑",
        "desc": "西风骑士团的制式长剑。轻快锐利之余，也能轻易导出元素力量。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/weapon/西风剑.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
